# Data Flow Diagrams
```mermaid
sequenceDiagram
  participant User
  participant CLI
  participant Loader as PDF Loader
  participant Store as Vector Store
  participant R as Retriever
  participant LLM
  participant Eval as RAGAS
  participant Reports

  User->>CLI: rag-eval --config configs/eval.yaml
  CLI->>Loader: Load PDFs
  Loader->>CLI: Documents with metadata
  CLI->>Store: Embed and index chunks
  CLI->>R: Build retrieval strategy
  loop Each question
    R->>Store: Retrieve context
    Store->>R: Top-k chunks
    R->>LLM: Question + context
    LLM->>R: Grounded answer
  end
  CLI->>Eval: Questions, answers, contexts, ground truth
  Eval->>Reports: Metric scores
```

# Online RAG Serving Flow

```mermaid
flowchart LR
  Q["User Query"] --> GW["API Gateway"]
  GW --> Guard["Policy and PII Guardrails"]
  Guard --> Ret["Retriever Router"]
  Ret --> Cache["Semantic Cache"]
  Ret --> VDB["Vector Database"]
  VDB --> Rank["Reranker"]
  Cache --> Rank
  Rank --> Prompt["Prompt Builder"]
  Prompt --> LLM["LLM Gateway"]
  LLM --> Verifier["Grounding Verifier"]
  Verifier --> Resp["Answer with Citations"]
  Verifier --> Logs["Quality and Cost Logs"]
```
